  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Increased Leadership for Resilient and Peaceful Societies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to contribute to gender equality, the empowerment of all women and girls and the fulfilment of their human rights in Moldova, Ukraine and Georgia. The project will support the implementation of UN Women&apos;s priorities for Ukraine, Moldova and Georgia respectively as well as supporting targeted activities anchored with the UN Women Regional Office in Istanbul. Overall, the programme is envis-aged to support; 1) Women, Peace and Security and implementation of National Action Plans in the three countries, 2) women&#x2019;s economic empowerment, 3) efforts to prevent violence against women and girls, 4) women&#x2019;s participation in leadership and political decision making and 5) the promotions of reforms and policies.</narrative>
  </description>
